  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SUPPORT VENEZUELAN PEDIATRIC RENAL PATIENTS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The situation of children and adolescents with stage V chronic kidney disease (CKD) in dialysis is very complex due to the suspension of Venezuela&apos;s public transplant program. This project will allow 20 children and adolescents with kidney disease on dialysis, who attend the main pediatric hospital in Venezuela, to have timely and effective diagnostic procedures, paraclinical examinations, medical treatment and nutritional support while they wait for a kidney transplant as  definitive health.</narrative>
  </description>
